<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">06062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran launched four drones toward shipping in the Strait of Hormuz this weekend, and American forces shot them down and struck radar sites on Goruk and Qeshm Island.</s> <s>A war that was paused two months ago has reignited around the chokepoint that carries a fifth of the world's oil.</s> <s>Whether a fragile new pause holds may decide if global crude prices spiral back into the conflict.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>France has opened a torture and war crimes investigation into Israel, its anti-terror prosecutors acting after more than thirty French nationals from last month's Gaza-bound flotilla reported sexual abuse, stress positions, and beatings in Israeli custody.</s> <s>A Western government's own justice system, not a human rights group, is now formally probing an ally.</s> <s>What began as a flotilla detention has become a criminal file in Paris.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Britain, the commentators Hasan Piker and Cenk Uygur were barred for criticizing Israel, and the Home Secretary who signed the ban once helped guide Labour Together, a think tank funded by illegally undisclosed pro-Israel money.</s> <s>Its most-funded lawmaker led the calls for that ban.</s> <s>It's a rare glimpse of how quiet financing converts into a state decision over who may speak.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Near Nyala in Sudan, weapons the Rapid Support Forces handed to allied tribes have turned old land rivalries into open war between the Salamat and the Beni Halba.</s> <s>A separate assault near Bara killed at least fifty-eight people over three days, residents said.</s> <s>By arming civilians, a paramilitary manufactures communal war as a tool of control — and it's now building a parallel state to rule what it breaks.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Eight soldiers were killed in an overnight raid on a Nigerian army base in Borno, along the Mandara axis where both Islamic State's West Africa Province and Boko Haram operate.</s> <s>The army issued no statement, and attribution remains contested between the two groups.</s> <s>After years of claimed victories, the silence itself tells you how much of the northeast still lies beyond government control.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An Abu Dhabi video agency called Viory, which markets verification services to newsrooms in twenty-two countries, shares server addresses and security certificates with Russia's sanctioned broadcaster RT, the investigators at Bellingcat found.</s> <s>Through thirty partnerships, it routes state propaganda into African, Asian, and Latin American outlets, scrubbed of its origin.</s> <s>The disinformation supply chain now hides inside the verification industry itself.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Pew survey of forty-four thousand people across thirty-six countries found a global median of sixty-seven percent now view Israel unfavorably, reaching ninety-nine percent in Turkey.</s> <s>Disapproval is near-universal in Muslim-majority nations and rising sharply among young Europeans, while South Korea's unfavorable rating jumped ten points.</s> <s>Public opinion is turning in places that governments long treated as reliably friendly.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The first New World screwworm in American livestock since nineteen sixty-six was confirmed this week in a Texas calf, traced to cattle smuggled from Central America through Mexico on falsified certificates.</s> <s>A criminal smuggling economy, not a natural outbreak, reintroduced a parasite eradicated six decades ago.</s> <s>A twenty-kilometer quarantine is in place, but the cost now falls on ranchers and cross-border trade.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's fertility rate has fallen faster than demographers projected, closing the demographic-dividend window before the country can fund pensions for its aging population.</s> <s>Rich nations grew old only after building welfare states; India is growing old with thin social infrastructure and a labor force that's already shrinking.</s> <s>Much of the Global South now faces the same trap — aging before it grows rich.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Saint Petersburg, Tanzania's President Hassan said her country holds uranium reserves and opened talks with Russia's Rosatom on nuclear energy.</s> <s>Tanzania has already drafted a national roadmap for small reactors, though no deal was signed at the economic forum.</s> <s>It's part of a pattern across Africa, where Rosatom offers nuclear access just as Western lenders hesitate.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Cardano's ADA token fell to sixteen cents this week, down seventy-five percent over the year to a four-year low.</s> <s>Its founder announced a break after warning of ecosystem failures, an analytics platform shut down, and the community voted against funding its own summit.</s> <s>Treasury funds sit undeployed — a reminder that on-chain activity, not price alone, reveals whether a crypto project is solvent.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Two billion people cannot afford to keep cool — no fans, no cold storage, no shaded work — even though they've contributed least to the warming that endangers them.</s> <s>Informal workers and women face the highest exposure where electricity grids are weakest, and heat stress cuts both productivity and survival.</s> <s>Financing cooling without adding emissions is the puzzle no one has yet solved.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China's solar installations collapsed by seventy-nine percent year-on-year in April, after the government replaced fixed-price tariffs with market-priced contracts.</s> <s>Developers can no longer secure financing without guaranteed revenue, stalling the world's largest clean-energy build-out.</s> <s>Whether Beijing meets its two-hundred-gigawatt target now depends on rules it can rewrite at will.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Scientists catalogued one thousand, one hundred and twenty-one new marine species in a single year, while an estimated two-point-two million remain unnamed.</s> <s>Nations have pledged to protect thirty percent of the oceans by twenty thirty, yet the science of naming life is underfunded and shrinking as a profession.</s> <s>Deep-sea mining advances against a baseline that doesn't yet exist.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Police in Pakistan arrested a TikToker for posting an AI-generated sexual video of a female rival and threatening to kill her.</s> <s>Cheap generative tools now let anyone fabricate sexualized deepfakes of named women, and Pakistani law had no provision for synthetic media before this arrest.</s> <s>A single local case is an early signal of a harm that scales globally as the tools spread.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ladybird, the only browser engine being built independent of Google's Chromium or Apple's WebKit, closed all public contributions this weekend.</s> <s>The project says AI tools have collapsed the effort signal that once made a large patch a proxy for good faith, leaving outside contributions unsafe to trust.</s> <s>Whether a maintainer-only model can sustain the open web's last independent engine is now an open question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Engineers at the American lab Anthropic say they now ship eight times more code each quarter with AI assistance, and the length of tasks their agents handle has doubled every four months.</s> <s>Two years ago the limit was four minutes; today it's twelve hours, with agents delegating work to other agents.</s> <s>Week-long tasks are within reach this year, and a system that helps train its own successor may not be far behind.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>